      "text": "Incorrect calculation & Deflationary token uncompatible Same ZABU finance incident Vulnerable code snippet: https://polygonscan.com/address/0xd4a7d5ca5232976ebf9c28b7231bfdbf4c4eee95#code#L1913 https://polygonscan.com/address/0x17684f4d5385fac79e75ceafc93f22d90066ed5c#code#L730 Due to PLX is a deflationary token 1.Deposit PLX tokens to SdoRewardPOOL to deduct PLX token in SdoRewardPOOL contract. 2.Until lp token balance in contract is 2. Then calculate a big reward value in updatePool function."
